{
  "abstract": "Principal path construction and simultaneous sharp bounds; exact 3-tree, clique-book, multipartite and lattice classifications. It also constructs, for every n ≥ 10, K5-free graphs of treewidth four with 3n − 5 edges supporting full-dimensional lattice indecomposable polytopal summands; no proper edge-subgraph supports a full-dimensional indecomposable polytopal weak summand.",
